window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Her new husband is the stuff of nightmares....</p> <p>Julia’s having a tough day. She’s learned that sacrificing virgins is still a thing in her homeland, and <i>she</i> is the virgin to be sacrificed. When alien conquerors capture her land, she’s immediately bound and delivered to the gruesome King of the Vandals. But this notorious alien is in for a rude awakening. He might think he’s getting a simpering princess to claim but Julia’s secret, outlawed magical powers can put an end to the mightiest of rulers. </p> <p>Does Julia destroy her scary new husband and save her people from his wrath? Or, has the battle-beast’s passion and love charmed a witch into choosing him above all else? </p>"; 
